        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Kwahu East District, Eastern Region, south Ghana, Abetifi, Pepease, Dissin, Ioba Province, Burkina Faso\n- Topics: district capitals, administrative divisions\n\nFacts:\n- Kwahu East District is one of the twenty-one districts in the Eastern Region of south Ghana.\n- Abetifi is a small town in south Ghana.\n- Abetifi is the capital of Kwahu East District in the Eastern Region of south Ghana.\n- Pepease is a village in Kwahu East District in the Eastern Region of south Ghana.\n- Dissin is a town in Ioba Province in Burkina Faso near the northwest corner of Ghana.\n- Dissin is the seat of Dissin Department in Ioba Province in Burkina Faso.",
